  <code>POST /upload/gmail/v1/users/{userId}/messages/send</code> <br> Sends the specified message to the recipients in the <code>To</code>, <code>Cc</code>, and <code>Bcc</code> headers.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td>
  <code><a href="https://developers.google.com/workspace/gmail/api/reference/rest/v1/users.messages/trash">trash</a></code></td>
  <td>
  <code>POST /gmail/v1/users/{userId}/messages/{id}/trash</code> <br> Moves the specified message to the trash.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td>
  <code><a href="https://developers.google.com/workspace/gmail/api/reference/rest/v1/users.messages/untrash">untrash</a></code></td>
  <td>
  <code>POST /gmail/v1/users/{userId}/messages/{id}/untrash</code> <br> Removes the specified message from the trash.</td>
  </tr>
  </tbody>
  </table>
  
