  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td>
  <code><a href="https://developers.google.com/workspace/gmail/api/reference/rest/v1/users.settings.cse.identities/get">get</a></code></td>
  <td>
  <code>GET /gmail/v1/users/{userId}/settings/cse/identities/{cseEmailAddress}</code> <br> Retrieves a client-side encryption identity configuration.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td>
