  <td>
  <code>POST /gmail/v1/users/{userId}/settings/cse/keypairs</code> <br> Creates and uploads a client-side encryption S/MIME public key certificate chain and private key metadata for the authenticated user.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td>
  <code><a href="https://developers.google.com/workspace/gmail/api/reference/rest/v1/users.settings.cse.keypairs/disable">disable</a></code></td>
