  <a id="Message.ClassificationLabelValue"></a>
  
  ### ClassificationLabelValue {#classificationlabelvalue}
  
  Classification Labels applied to the email message. Classification Labels are different from Gmail inbox labels. Only used for Google Workspace accounts. [Learn more about classification labels](https://support.google.com/a/answer/9292382).
  
  <a id="Message.ClassificationLabelValue.SCHEMA_REPRESENTATION"></a>
  
  <table>
  <thead>
  <tr>
  <th>JSON representation</th>
  </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
  <tr>
  <td><div></div><div><pre><span>{</span>
    <span>"labelId"</span><span>: </span><span>string</span><span>,</span>
    <span>"fields"</span><span>: </span><span>[</span>
      <span>{</span>
