  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td>
  <h3 id="import"><code><a href="https://developers.google.com/workspace/gmail/api/reference/rest/v1/users.messages/import">import</a></code></h3></td>
  <td> Imports a message into only this user's mailbox, with standard email delivery scanning and classification similar to receiving via SMTP.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td>
  <h3 id="insert"><code><a href="https://developers.google.com/workspace/gmail/api/reference/rest/v1/users.messages/insert">insert</a></code></h3></td>
  <td> Directly inserts a message into only this user's mailbox similar to <code>IMAP APPEND</code>, bypassing most scanning and classification.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
  <td>
  <h3 id="list"><code><a href="https://developers.google.com/workspace/gmail/api/reference/rest/v1/users.messages/list">list</a></code></h3></td>
