  ![personal Microsoft accounts](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/images/permissions-reference/msa.svg "personal Microsoft accounts (MSA)") The *Mail.ReadWrite* delegated permission is available for consent in personal Microsoft accounts.
  
  Administrators can configure [application access policy](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/auth-limit-mailbox-access) to limit app access to *specific* mailboxes and not to all the mailboxes in the organization, even if the app has been granted the *Mail.ReadWrite* application permission.
  
