  ![personal Microsoft accounts](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/images/permissions-reference/msa.svg "personal Microsoft accounts (MSA)") The *Notifications.ReadWrite.CreatedByApp* delegated permission is available for consent in personal Microsoft accounts.
  
