  ### openid {#openid}
  
  | Category             | Application | Delegated                                                                                                                       |
  | -------------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
  | Identifier           | -           | 37f7f235-527c-4136-accd-4a02d197296e                                                                                            |
