  With some resource collections, you can also specify the properties to be returned in the expanded resources by adding a `$select` parameter. The following example performs the same query as the previous example but uses a [`$select`](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/query-parameters?tabs=http#select) statement to limit the properties returned for the expanded child items to the **id** and **name** properties.
  
