  ## Filter {#filter}
  
  Use the `$filter` query parameter to get just a subset of a collection. For guidance on using `$filter`, see [Use the $filter query parameter to filter a collection of objects](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/filter-query-parameter).
  
  ## Format {#format}
  
  Use the `$format` query parameter to specify the media format of the items returned from Microsoft Graph.
  
  For example, the following request returns the users in the organization in JSON format:
  
  ### HTTP
  
  ```http
  GET https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/users?$format=json
  ```
  
