# name: test_markdown_snapshot[mslearn/graph]
  '''
  # Microsoft Graph documentation {#hero-title}
  
  Microsoft Graph is the gateway to data and intelligence in Microsoft 365. Use Microsoft Graph to build intelligent apps, derive insights and analytics, and extend Microsoft 365 experiences.
  
  Overview
  
  [What is Microsoft Graph?](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/overview)
  
  Reference
  
  [Microsoft Graph REST API](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/api/overview?view=graph-rest-1.0&preserve-view=true)
  
  What's new
  
  [Microsoft MCP Server for Enterprise](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/mcp-server/overview)
  
  What's new
  
  [API Changelog](https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/changelog)
  
  ## Services and features
  
  ### Users
  
  - [Access and manipulate user resources directly.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/azuread-users-concept-overview)
  
  ### Groups
  
  - [Enable user collaboration and integration across services.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/microsoft365-groups-concept-overview)
  
  ### Identity and access management
  
  - [Use Microsoft Entra methods to manage access and authenticate users.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/identity-network-access-overview)
  
  ### Security
  
  - [Connect Microsoft security products, services, and partners to streamline security operations.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/security-concept-overview)
  
  ### Microsoft Teams teamwork and communications
  
  - [Explore chat-based collaboration, meetings, calling, and enterprise voice features.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/teams-concept-overview)
  
  ### Outlook calendar and mail
  
  - [Control calendars such as creating an event.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/outlook-calendar-concept-overview)
  
  - [Access and manage messages and mail data.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/outlook-mail-concept-overview)
  
  ### Microsoft 365 Copilot connectors
  
  - [Explore Copilot connectors.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/connecting-external-content-connectors-overview)
  
  - [Build your first connector.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/connecting-external-content-build-quickstart)
  
  ### Microsoft Graph Data Connect
  
  - [Explore Microsoft Graph Data Connect.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/data-connect-concept-overview)
  
  - [Build a Data Connect application.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/data-connect-quickstart)
  
  ### All services and features
  
  - [Explore services for productivity, collaboration, people and workplace intelligence, education, and more.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/overview-major-services)
  
  - [Find out what's new in the beta and v1.0 APIs.](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/whats-new-overview)
  
  ## SDKs and tools
  
  [SDKs](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/sdks/sdks-overview)
  
  [Graph Explorer](https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/graph-explorer)
  
  [Microsoft Graph Toolkit](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/toolkit/overview)
  
  [IaC templates](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/templates/)
  
  [Microsoft MCP Server for Enterprise](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/mcp-server/overview)
  
  ## Resources
  
  ### Training and tutorials
  
  - [Quick Start](https://developer.microsoft.com/graph/quick-start)
  - [Microsoft Graph fundamentals](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/paths/m365-msgraph-fundamentals/)
  - [Microsoft Graph learning paths](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/training/browse/?products=ms-graph&resource_type=learning%20path)
  - [Tutorials](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/tutorials)
  
  ### Community
  
  - [Microsoft Graph blog](https://developer.microsoft.com/graph/blogs/)
  - [Videos and podcasts](https://developer.microsoft.com/graph/gallery/?filterBy=Videos,Podcasts)
  - [Monthly community calls](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLWZJrkeLOrbabneRhISU-N7uK4PvVy-jV)
  
  ### Support
  
  - [Microsoft Graph support](https://developer.microsoft.com/graph/support)
  - [Microsoft Graph Q&A community support](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/answers/products/graph)
  - [Microsoft Graph feedback portal](https://feedbackportal.microsoft.com/feedback/forum/ebe2edae-97d1-ec11-a7b5-0022481f3c80)
  - [Known issues](https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/graph/known-issues)
  
